HEEx function components (Section 26.5) arrive with Slice 1, including the
`<.fact_badge>` that Section 26.3 makes mandatory on every fact fragment.

Components receive plain immutable view-model structs built from already
authorized Ash results; Section 26.5 forbids them from running Ash queries or
touching raw Ecto schemas.

This file exists because git does not track empty directories, and Section 20
requires this one to be present in a fresh checkout.
